            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>LawnMaster OcuMow® robot mowers combine a camera and sensors with Optical Grass Recognition (OGR) software to identify grass and navigate around your lawn without the need for a boundary wire, outdoor power socket or app.</p>",
